# Planner opens done: production scoring puts a running coder above an idle planner.
# The final frame restores the opening roster; completed children leave before wrap.
# The selected coder and its read receipt remain until the fresh runtime at wrap.
scenario pilot width 54 height 34 length 25s pets off
agent @planner claude
agent @coder codex
0s @planner done "plan approved"
0s @coder idle
1s @coder runs "implement the sidebar story"
3s @coder spawns @otter codex "check the model"
4s @coder spawns @fox claude "review the renderer"
5s ui expand @coder # show the nested reviewers
6s @fox done "renderer reviewed"
7s @coder waits 5s "child reviews"
10s @otter done "model checked"
12s ui select @planner # hold the current layout
12.5s @coder asks "Ship the sidebar story?" # ask during the layout freeze
17.5s ui expand @coder
19s @coder answered
21s @coder done "sidebar story shipped"
23s @otter leaves
23s @fox leaves
24s @coder idle
